1
00:00:00,429 --> 00:00:02,209
(Sheldon:)and then to cap off the perfect day,

2
00:00:02,364 --> 00:00:05,404
(Sheldon:)the Los Angeles Bureau
of Weights and Measures.

3
00:00:06,768 --> 00:00:09,268
(Leonard:)I thought the measures were
going to be the stars of the show.

4
00:00:09,438 --> 00:00:12,078
(Leonard:)Turns out it was the weights.

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:15,080
(Penny:)I'm so glad you guys
are friends again.

6
00:00:15,243 --> 00:00:18,383
(Sheldon:)And I'm glad you and I
are friends again, too.

7
00:00:18,547 --> 00:00:21,927
(Sheldon:)Which reminds me. This came in the
mail, and I want you to have it.

8
00:00:22,084 --> 00:00:25,434
"Fifty cents off Vagisil."

9
00:00:27,055 --> 00:00:29,595
(Sheldon:)Think of me when you apply it.

10
00:00:32,461 --> 00:00:35,771
(Raj:)Can I just say, I've missed
all of us hanging out together.

11
00:00:35,931 --> 00:00:37,431
(Penny:)-Yeah.
-Me too.

12
00:00:37,599 --> 00:00:41,809
Um, since when can Kcothrappali talk
in front of the girls without a beer?

13
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:43,950
(Bernadette:)Oh, that happened
right after you left.

14
00:00:44,106 --> 00:00:45,486
(Leonard:)And no one told me?

15
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:49,090
(Howard(crying):)Can't believe we forgot to tell him.

16
00:00:50,812 --> 00:00:53,652
Ahem. Think of Sheldon
when you apply it.

